  "mgStyles": {
    "_about": "mg-styles-15 (Vincentwei1021): 15 motion-design styles, each a prompt (prompts/<id>.md), a 10 s film made in code and its source. The read-only clone at the pinned commit, shallow and sparse (no videos/, no audio samples or WAV/FLAC/MP3); the app reads prompts/, demos/, docs/readme/films/ (the style cards) and assets/ from it and never edits it. Demo films are linked (GitHub Pages), never downloaded. MIT.",
