    "skill": "skills/anidoodle"
  },
  "whatIf": {
    "_about": "What If animation (FreshStack, MIT): the sixth author of the Style Gallery. The stick-figure engine (studio/src/engine: React + SVG, one rig, rooms, light) is used as shipped through the app's stand-in for Remotion (packages/what-if-styles/shims, written from Remotion's docs; no Remotion package), bundled with the author's React (codeLibs react, react-dom, scheduler). Its knowledge also lives in config/rules (what-if, moworks-studio). The copy in bundle/styles/what-if-animation is the pinned commit's skill, references, scripts and studio/src, never edited; no sound (the author's voices and effects are ElevenLabs-made: studio/public and studio/library are left out). Update: git fetch in a clone, read the diff of studio/src and references, copy the same paths at the new commit, run test/what-if-engine.test.mjs and test/what-if.test.mjs, re-pin after the maintainer's OK",
    "repo": "kelano86/what-if-animation",
